/**
 * App.jsx — Multi-tenant BGV Portal
 *
 * FIX: Super Admin's internal staff can now see their allocated clients + records.
 *
 * ROOT CAUSE:
 * Internal staff (isInternal=true, tenantId=null, ownerAdminEmail=null) had no
 * path in visibleClients or loadAllocationsForUser to find the super admin's
 * allocation key (clientAllocations_superadmin@tervies.com).
 *
 * THE FIX (3 places):
 * 1. loadAllocationsForUser — adds a path for internal staff to find SA allocations
 * 2. visibleClients useMemo — adds internal staff lookup via SUPER_ADMIN_EMAIL
 * 3. loadClientsDataForUser — internal staff now reads from SA's DB data (they have
 *    no tenantId so tenant-keyed lookup always returned null)
 *
 * All other fixes preserved (no dancing rows, company admin DB sync, etc.)
 */

